# NOTE: this file applies to builds whose context is this repository root.
# No image is built that way any more:
#   - Dockerfile, Dockerfile.edge and playground/Dockerfile build from the
#     prepared core checkout (.build/core, see scripts/prepare-core-context.sh),
#     which has its own — currently absent — .dockerignore.
#   - docker/Dockerfile.seed builds with ./docker as its context.
# It is kept only so an ad-hoc `docker build .` from the repository root stays
# cheap. Do not copy these rules into the core context: they would exclude
# core's own src/, tests/ and docs/ trees.

.git
.github
.gitattributes
.pre-commit-config.yaml
.editorconfig
*.md
!README.md
LICENSE
docs/
tests/
demos/
monitoring/
benchmark-results/
k8s/
helm/
